    int Unknown15C <comment="All supplied records contain zero. No confirmed stock-game consumer; preserve these four bytes. It is addressable arithmetically as flag word 3 for indexes 96..127, but no such caller was recovered. Direct +0x15C hits in player movement refer to player-object state, not automatically to the parameter record.">;
