        TDppJob JobType <comment="Indexed parameter 2. Negative values normalize to 0. Pause-menu filtering: type 0 excludes sys_free_command_039; type 1 excludes sys_free_command_018. Broader meaning of the category is unresolved. Fresh direct/wrapper audits still find a command-list role rather than a combat-state switch. Only 3mfn has value 1 in the supplied asset. This correlation alone does not prove a general Samurai class or enable samurai abilities.">;
